# oc-sim scenario v1
# RATCHET's inputs (journal/D-032): launch it from the app menu as in
# ratchet.scn, click the right encoder on COUNT to change its input, turn five
# detents (--, CV1= .. CV4=, then CV1+) and stay there: the snapshot shows
# CV1+ in a dark box on the lit row, what the right encoder turns now.
ticks 300
20  button up down
60  button down down
70  button up up
70  button down up
90  button down down
100 button down up
110 button down down
120 button down up
130 button down down
140 button down up
160 button left down
166 button left up
200 button right down
206 button right up
230 encoder 2 +5
